Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.54,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:24.12,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,So which one are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:28.09,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:29.60,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Gojou Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:32.09,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in charge of the \Nfirst-years at Jujutsu Tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:34.45,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Jujutsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:37.32,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Fushiguro... Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:43.02,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:47.74,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure you should \Nbe worrying about others,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.52,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:54.11,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It's been decided that you'll \Nbe secretly executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:11.96,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(1191,431)\t(1192,1316,1 \c&H0700D7&\3c&H6659E4&)\t(1317,1941,1 \c&H172918&\3c&H8CCECB&)\t(6197,6529,1 \c&H0F0063&\3c&H222781&)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:31.70,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1)\pos(612,310)}Episode 1: Ryoumen Sukuna
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:31.70,Main,Plate,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(314,104)\an8\b1\c&H1D394B&\bord0\shad0\fnArial\fs28\be.25}Itadori
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:30.66,Italics,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Hello, Sugisawa Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.71,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, this is Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.11,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I just called earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:34.43,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.81,0:02:35.46,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:37.46,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to keep calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:39.22,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,but how is my grandpa doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:42.25,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I thought they already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.54,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, please hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.49,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go ask myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:52.04,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori-san never uses his call button.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.98,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,It's actually scary that he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:56.98,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori-san, you have a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.95,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuji-kun's asking if you \Nwant him to bring any—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.20,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.70,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Tell him not to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.95,Italics,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,He should go to his club! His club!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.55,Italics,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:09.98,Italics,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:11.42,Italics,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,What club are you in, Yuuji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:13.89,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:16.21,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come by tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.54,sign_4777_40_Miyashiro_Prefec,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Miyashiro Prefectural Sugisawa Third High School
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:33.58,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They're keeping a cursed \Nobject in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:35.02,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Could they be any dumber?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:49.12,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:50.03,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:52.10,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The Stevenson screen's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:54.27,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,For real? That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:55.77,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it took a nighttime stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.04,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'll punch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:04:00.37,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Well, no going home \Nuntil it's recovered, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:05.01,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm seriously going to punch him next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:11.81,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:13.77,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Are you really sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.76,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\c&H543D2C&\3c&HCBCCBC&\shad0\bord3\an8\fs20}Occult Phenomenon\NResearch Club
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.90,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Sasaki-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.02,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Iguchi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.28,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.43,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Spirits, spirits, please tell us...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:24.98,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Which creature is the council \Npresident just barely weaker than?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:27.90,Main,All&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(173,1)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs80\bord0\shad0\c&H0E0F0C&\an5\t(\fs84)\pos(158,100)\be1}Ku
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:30.12,Main,All&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Ku-ri-o-ne (sea angel)?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:28.73,Main,All&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(173,1)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs80\bord0\shad0\c&H0E0F0C&\an5\t(\fs84)\be1\pos(490,66)}ri
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:29.32,Main,All&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(173,1)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs80\bord0\shad0\c&H0E0F0C&\an5\t(\fs84)\be1\pos(192,230)}o
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:30.11,Main,All&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(173,1)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs80\bord0\shad0\c&H0E0F0C&\an5\t(\fs84)\be1\pos(442.667,107)}ne
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.94,sign_6477_66_Sea_Angel,Sidebar,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(520,181)}Sea Angel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.94,sign_6477_67_A_type_of_plankt,Sidebar,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(578,183)}A type of plankton\Nliving in cold oceans!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.94,sign_6477_67_A_type_of_plankt,Sidebar,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(519.334,210)\fscx95}A transparent\N{\fscx100}body!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.94,sign_6477_67_A_type_of_plankt,Sidebar,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs8\pos(586,206)}It's actually\Nrelated\Nto mollusks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.94,sign_6477_67_A_type_of_plankt,Sidebar,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs8\pos(522,278.667)}It moves its legs,\Nwhich look\Nlike wings,\Nto float around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.94,sign_6477_67_A_type_of_plankt,Sidebar,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs8\pos(576.667,326.667)}When capturing prey,\Nits mouth pops open\Nand shoots out tentacles!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.94,sign_6477_67_A_type_of_plankt,Sidebar,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs8\pos(577.6,305.5)\3c&HF9FDFC&}Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:31.86,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,A sea angel can beat him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:33.41,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What a small fry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:34.72,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,Occult club!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:37.33,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Plankton President! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:38.28,Main,Paper,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\c&H636867&\bord0\shad0\b1\frx36\fry12\frz317.5\pos(438,50)}Notice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:40.58,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,As you were previously informed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:43.54,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,a research club with no real activities \Nmust forfeit its club room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:45.07,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,So vacate this room at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:49.35,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't underestimate \Nour members, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:50.14,sign_6948_80_Mysterious_Event,Book,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(264.333,256)}Mysterious Events\NFile 9
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:53.15,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:57.44,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,You know about our rugby field \Nbeing closed off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:04:58.72,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:01.57,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,Some of the students who fell \Nill were actually hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.49,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think that's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:05.70,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,We're talking about tough rugby players here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:09.29,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Truth is, the players said \Nthey started hearing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:10.28,sign_7411_88_B_i_n_g,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(197,1)\fscy80\pos(334,68)}B\Ni\Nn\Ng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:13.79,sign_7411_88_B_i_n_g,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz0\pos(366,82)}O\No\No\No\No
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:13.79,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,mysterious sounds and voices \Nright before they fell ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:17.25,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,That's when we found this newspaper \Narticle from thirty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:20.54,sign_7608_94_Former_Employee_,CenterHeadline,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1500,1)\an5\pos(345,180)}Belongings Found\Non Roadside, \NPossible Crime
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:20.79,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,It talks about the disappearance of Yoshida-san, \Nwho worked with the construction company,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:19.38,sign_7581_92_35_Year_Old_Form,Headline,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,1)\pos(320,20)\an8}Former Employee, Age 35, Goes Missing at Sugisawa
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:20.54,sign_7608_94_Former_Employee_,RightHeadline,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1500,1)}Former Employee of a\NMajor Construction Company\NNever Made a Comeback\Nand Went Into Debt
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:23.12,sign_7608_94_Former_Employee_,RightHeadline,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(405,1)\an5}Last\NSighted\Nat\NSugisawa\NThird
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:23.12,sign_7608_94_Former_Employee_,CenterHeadline,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(405,1)\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(400,60)}Laid Off from Work\NFailed to Start New Enterprise\NPossible Suicide
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:25.80,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,and it mentions he was last sighted here at \NSugisawa Third High School during construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:29.01,sign_7836_100_Laid_Off_From_Wo,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(632,140)\pos(320,20)}Laid Off from Work\NFailed to Start New Enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:29.32,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshida-san was struggling to make ends meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:31.01,sign_7836_100_Laid_Off_From_Wo,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(147,138)\pos(320,20)}Continuous Collection Calls\NThreatening Calls and Faxes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:30.76,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,so he turned to loan sharks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.81,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,and those organizations were after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.80,sign_7836_100_Laid_Off_From_Wo,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(149,1)\pos(320,20)}Suspicious Men at His Home\NPossible Kidnapping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:34.32,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Which means!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:37.48,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,The whole disaster at the \Nrugby field was caused by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.81,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,the vengeful spirit of Yoshida-san, \Nwho's buried there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:41.11,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(264,290)\fs18\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H4F524E&\3c&HF8F8F8&\shad0}Vengeful Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:43.32,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,No, it was caused by ticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:43.32,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs18\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H4F524E&\3c&HF8F8F8&\shad0\pos(126,288.667)}Vengeful Spirit
