Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_112_A_large__parasit,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(323,160)}A large,\Nparasitic tick\Nthat sucks the blood\Nof animals and humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_112_A_large__parasit,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs14\q2\pos(320,26)}Be careful, because they can be carriers of\N{\c&H3725B7&}infectious diseases {\c}that lead to {\c&H3423B6&}death {\c}if they bite humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_112_A_large__parasit,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\q2\an8\fs12\b0\fscx80\pos(448,90)}Diseases such as Severe Fever with Thrombocytopenia Syndrome (SFTS)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_115_Hmm_,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_116_They_leap_onto_t,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,They leap onto targets\Nfrom grass and bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_116_They_leap_onto_t,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(234,270)}Burp
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_116_They_leap_onto_t,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(38,186)\frz17.98\c&H7A9FC2&}Leap
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_116_They_leap_onto_t,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(72,271.333)}Size
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_116_They_leap_onto_t,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\an5\pos(125,233)}Before Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_116_They_leap_onto_t,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\an5\pos(196,233)}After Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:52.19,sign_8270_116_They_leap_onto_t,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(269.999,256.667)\q2}After sucking blood, their size\Ncan increase up to {\c&H5147B5&}100x{\c}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:46.33,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,Hard ticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.20,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,A large, blood-sucking bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:51.14,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,If one bites you and infects you with SFTS,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:52.57,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,it can be fatal, so be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:53.92,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,So what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.33,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,The occult club is trying \Nto uncover occult activity,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.08,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,so it's still a proper club activity report!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.23,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't some kid's game!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:01.76,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, the biggest problem is you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.18,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori Yuuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:05.38,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,You're registered with track \Nand field, not the occult club,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:10.05,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,so this club doesn't even have the \Nthree members required for any club!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:10.04,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(295,1)\fnArial\b1\an8\c&H0E1A18&\bord2\shad0\3c&HFAFAFA&}Not Enough Members
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:10.97,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.43,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:14.56,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,No, I know I wrote down the occult club.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:16.56,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,I rewrote it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,The track and field coach, Takagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:21.94,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori, we need you so we \Ncan conquer the nationals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.61,Italics,President,0000,0000,0000,,A teacher more problematic than \Nthe students just showed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:29.17,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Give it a rest! How many times \Ndo I have to tell you I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:29.77,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:30.57,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:32.62,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,However, I'm not some demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:34.99,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,If you can beat me, then I'll give up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:38.50,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's settle it fair and square on the track!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:39.90,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Now it's interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.65,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:47.84,sign_9617_151_Track_and_Field_,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(509,1)\fscx80\pos(101,10)\t(2178,2303,1 \3c&H414141&\4c&H414141&)}Track and Field Coach
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:47.84,sign_9617_151_Track_and_Field_,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(509,1)\pos(99,75)\t(2178,2303,1 \3c&H414141&\4c&H414141&)}Takagi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:47.84,sign_9617_151_Track_and_Field_,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(509,1)\pos(484,155)\t(2178,2303,1 \3c&H414141&\4c&H414141&)}Itadori
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:47.47,Main,President,0000,0000,0000,,Is it "fair and square" to rewrite \Na student's club application?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.55,0:06:54.91,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What's with this rugby field?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:07:00.06,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a dead body \Nburied here or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:01.98,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Even if there is,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:04.62,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised to see one this high-leveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:07.06,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably a grade 2 curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:09.53,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Must be that cursed object's influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:19.03,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H4D2FB0&\3c&HB4A8AA&\shad0\fs12\fay.43\frx350\fry336\pos(274.667,224)}No Unauthorized Entry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:12.87,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.16,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Its presence is too strong to pin down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.49,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It feels like it's close by, \Nbut it could still be far away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:22.29,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This special-grade cursed \Nobject is a serious pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:25.09,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Who could have moved it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.61,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:28.87,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:32.25,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Coach Takagi is taking on \NItadori from West Middle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:34.27,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, what are they competing in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.75,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:40.27,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Fourteen meters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:41.84,sign_11038_173__Japan_s_Nationa,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,*Japan's National Record
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:44.62,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Takagi's still got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:54.32,Main,Students,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Itadori! Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:46.08,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,What're you gonna do, Itadori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.13,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, is Itadori famous or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:51.59,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,They're probably tall tales, but I heard \Nhe beat all stages of {\i1}Ninja Warrior{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:53.89,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,and that he's the reincarnation \Nof Mirko Cro Cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:56.83,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,But Mirko's not even dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:59.89,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,Still, he earned the nickname \N"Tiger of West Middle."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:01.08,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:03.34,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, can I just throw this however I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:06.52,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. I won't call any fouls, \Nso throw however you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:07.59,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:09.95,Main,Takagi,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to demonstrate how \Nserious I am by intentionally
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:12.05,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,choosing something that isn't your forte—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:19.06,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, roughly thirty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:19.05,sign_11038_173__Japan_s_Nationa,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(512,234)}*World Record
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:21.52,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.83,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,He's more gorilla than tiger, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:25.52,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,That was a pitcher's throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:29.02,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori, you'd do well on a sports team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:32.11,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to force yourself to \Nstay in our occult club, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.06,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:35.96,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,But as much as you two love scary things,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,you couldn't go to haunted \Nplaces without me, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:39.01,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\blur.25\an8\pos(583.667,155.667)}Shiver
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:39.01,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\blur.25\an8\pos(355.333,125.333)}Tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:39.01,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\3c&H1AE6EC&\c&H192B2B&\shad0\blur.5\pos(574,277)}3 Days Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:40.62,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,We're scared {\i1}because{\i0} we like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.04,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.80,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, this school requires \Neveryone to be in a club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.25,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't keep up with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:48.07,Flashback,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to do anything!\NYou can be a ghost member!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:50.24,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\c&H1C1C1C&\3c&HF9F9F9&\shad0\bord3\an8\fs20}Occult Phenomenon\NResearch Club
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:49.54,Flashback,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,We're the occult club, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:51.76,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,I did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.85,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be able to go home \Nby 5 PM for my own reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.76,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,So if it's okay with you, I'd like to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:09:00.01,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I like the atmosphere of \Nthe occult club a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:02.52,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if that's how it is, we don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:03.74,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.84,0:09:06.55,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That guy's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:09.32,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He pulled that off without any cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:11.86,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he's like Zenin-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:14.79,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's already half past four!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:17.28,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Coach, I've got stuff to do! Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:28.44,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The presence of a cursed object!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:29.21,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.40,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He's way too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:34.29,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,I heard he can run fifty \Nmeters in three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:35.72,Main,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Is he a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:35.71,sign_11038_173__Japan_s_Nationa,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(320,205)}*World Record\N5.47s+
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:49.26,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs16\c&H3D8A92&\3c&HBCF9F4&\shad0\frx14\fry344\fay-.21\pos(386.666,64.666)}Sugisawa Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.26,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H989B9A&\3c&HFAFDFD&\pos(374.667,170.666)\fay.17\frx0\fry20}Itadori
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.26,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H989B9A&\3c&HFAFDFD&\fay.12\frx0\fry20\pos(376,244)}Saitou
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.27,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,I told you not to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:53.76,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Stop buying flowers to bring \Nwith you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:55.20,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You always give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.24,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, these aren't for you. \NThey're for the nurses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:09:59.68,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,All the more reason not to, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:01.49,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,And what about your club?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:02.97,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Go to your club! Your club!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.87,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.80,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,It ends before 5 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:09.93,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be visiting you \Nif I didn't have the free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:11.13,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:14.13,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Then listen to me, since I've got free time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:15.68,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:17.18,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Just listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:19.93,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I want \Nto tell you before the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:22.47,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,It's about your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:24.14,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I said I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:28.10,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, could stop trying to \Nact all cool before you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:31.60,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Every man wants to go out in style, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:33.79,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Get a clue, you useless grandson!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:36.07,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Quit snapping over everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:38.64,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You can just be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:42.85,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk. Lax upbringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:50.54,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:51.54,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.91,0:10:54.79,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,You're a strong kid, so help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:58.90,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's only those closest to you, \Njust save the people you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:00.38,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay if you lose your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:03.14,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,and don't worry about whether \Nthey'll thank you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:06.52,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Just save as many people as you can, \Neven if it's only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.53,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,When you die, you should \Nbe surrounded by people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:13.57,Main,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Don't end up like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:25.52,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.94,Main,ScreenLeft,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(268,84)\fs12\b1\3c&H77D2F9&\shad0\an8}Nurse Call
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.94,sign_16448_266_Matsumoto,ScreenRight,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(580,10)}Matsumoto
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.94,sign_16448_266_Matsumoto,ScreenRight,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(581.333,74.667)}Hanai
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.94,sign_16448_266_Matsumoto,ScreenRight,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(580,138)}Eguchi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.94,sign_16448_266_Matsumoto,ScreenRight,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(580,200)\3c&HDAE3E2&\c&H68706E&}Akita
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.94,sign_16448_266_Matsumoto,ScreenRight,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(580,268)\c&H606464&\3c&HC1C4CC&}Itadori
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.94,sign_16448_266_Matsumoto,ScreenRight,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(580,332)\c&H484A4A&\3c&HA2A5A4&}Kosaka
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.51,0:11:30.52,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:33.99,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:35.17,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:39.66,Italics,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:45.14,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,My grandpa... is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.57,Main,Paper,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs14\c&H7C7C7C&\3c&HF2F2F2&\shad0\fay.1\frz142.7\frx38\fry8\pos(326,312.667)}Notification of Death
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:12.08,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:14.27,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,That's all of the necessary paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:16.62,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:18.34,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:22.33,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this is my first time dealing \Nwith something like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:24.80,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,so it doesn't feel real yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:29.51,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa would snap if I kept \Nmoping around forever, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:31.89,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll just have to laugh as I roast him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.25,Main,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Phrasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:36.86,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori Yuuji, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:40.93,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Fushiguro from Jujutsu Tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:42.67,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to have a word with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:43.36,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I'm in mourning right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.62,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but there isn't time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:50.31,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The cursed object you \Npossess is very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:51.98,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Hand it over to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:53.37,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Cursed object?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:54.77,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:58.59,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah, yeah. I found that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:02.51,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind either way, \Nbut my senpai took a liking to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:04.25,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "dangerous"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:07.80,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The number of unexplained \Ndeaths and missing persons
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:11.01,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,within Japan exceeds \N10,000 a year on average.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:08.72,sign_18893_302_4th_grade_Girl_C,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(400,1)\pos(236,75)\fscx80}4th-grade Girl Commits Suicide. Bullying Suspected.\NSuicide Note Read, "They Told Me to Die."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.01,sign_18893_302_4th_grade_Girl_C,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(582,1)\pos(240.667,68)\fscx75\frz338}Head of Nursing Home in Mifune Ward Stabbed to Death.\NFormer Patient Unindicted Once Again
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:14.54,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Most of those are the result of curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:16.53,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Curses?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:18.71,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if you believe in them or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:20.02,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They're real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:21.53,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:26.03,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Large pools of negative energy form especially \Neasily in schools, hospitals, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:29.07,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Hardship, regret, shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:32.06,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The negative emotions of mankind \Nbecome the source of curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:37.00,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's why most schools secretly keep a \Ncursed object such as a protective talisman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:39.50,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The object you found is one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:42.26,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,If it's protecting us, shouldn't \Nwe be grateful for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:43.63,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.82,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Placing a cursed object of greater evil
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.14,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,is a deadly poison that \Nkeeps other curses away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:51.95,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bad practice that \Nonly claims to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.57,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Over the years, its seal weakens,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:59.52,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,and then it becomes bait to lure \Nin and fatten up other curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:02.44,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The object you found
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:05.54,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,is a dangerous one, \Nclassified as special-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.45,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Hand it over before people start dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:10.51,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I already said I don't mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:12.00,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,So go tell it to my senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.26,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:17.05,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I was just following the \Ntaint clinging to the box?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.42,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Where are the contents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:23.39,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I already told you, my senpai... have it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:24.97,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:29.05,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, they were talking about removing \Nthe talisman from it tonight at the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:33.75,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What? Is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:37.39,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's worse than bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.53,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:46.91,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:49.73,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,Did we really need to sneak in to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:51.03,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm turning on the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:53.36,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,No! The atmosphere's important!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:56.28,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Enjoying the thrill is in the \Nspirit of the occult club, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:58.65,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like anything's \Ngoing to happen, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.55,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it came off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.35,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,A human finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:19.35,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Is it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:24.54,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.52,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:35.45,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Do talismans come off that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:38.54,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's impossible for people \Nwho lack cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:40.44,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:42.90,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Go right! It's a shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.17,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This time the object itself is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:48.23,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The seal is ancient. \NIt might as well be plain paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:52.30,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I still don't get all this stuff about curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:53.53,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:54.76,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Fourth floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.80,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What is this pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:02.44,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.15,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:06.44,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:08.45,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I've only known them a few months,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:10.44,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,but they're my friends. I can't just stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.70,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:17.07,sign_23361_367_Occult_Phenomeno,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Occult Phenomenon\NResearch Club
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:24.00,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:32.05,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,The hour hand is at eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:34.08,Italics,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,What is that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:35.81,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sasaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:38.77,Main,Sasaki,0000,0000,0000,,Iguchi? Thank goodness! Where have you—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:41.92,Main,Iguchi,0000,0000,0000,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:48.07,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:50.03,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The curse has been unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:52.61,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Its presence is still all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:55.41,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,Slurp, slurp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:56.78,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:58.20,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Demon Dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:05.62,Main,Curse,0000,0000,0000,,Slurp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:07.30,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:12.32,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Am I just going to wait \Nhere like he told me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:15.63,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What am I so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:18.22,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:19.89,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:21.98,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I can sense death all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.01,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:25.66,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Was I afraid of it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:28.23,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't feel like I was, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:31.51,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't cry because I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.51,0:17:33.48,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I was just a little sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:37.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,But my grandpa's death \Nand the death I'm facing now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:40.49,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,How are they any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:44.37,Flashback,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,You're a strong kid, so help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.31,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The curses are growing in number.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:53.39,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,They're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:02.47,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:06.14,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,He was short-tempered and stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:09.15,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,No one but me ever paid him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:13.02,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,"Don't end up like me," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.65,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:17.86,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! Is it trying to swallow her \Nalong with the cursed object?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:20.82,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:31.54,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:35.17,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I think you had a proper death, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:37.51,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:41.08,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,This death...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.97,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.37,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,So this is a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.37,0:18:53.07,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Not what I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:19:00.32,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I want to ask you what you're doing here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:01.67,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:03.25,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Why so haughty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:07.45,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, what's that \Nmunching on the curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:08.99,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,My shikigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.99,0:19:10.79,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You can see them, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:13.10,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Normally a curse can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:16.19,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Not unless you're on the verge of \Ndeath or in special places like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.19,0:19:18.07,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:20.72,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen a ghost or \Nanything before tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:23.72,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You're not scared, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:26.71,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I was scared for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:27.86,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,But did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:29.69,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,People really can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:30.69,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.05,0:19:36.04,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,So I at least want the people \NI know to have proper deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.54,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Not that I really get it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:39.39,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:40.39,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,This it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:41.40,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:44.33,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's the special-grade cursed \Nobject, Ryoumen Sukuna's finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.63,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's a miracle it didn't get swallowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:48.05,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Why would anything eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:49.12,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Does it taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:49.96,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:52.44,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You'd do it to gain stronger cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.46,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous, so hand it over already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:56.11,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:01.80,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.31,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:14.77,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Nue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:39.44,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, I can't think straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.75,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:44.89,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't you understand \Nto take those two and run?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:47.98,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You're in big trouble yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:54.42,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Only curses can exorcise other curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:55.69,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You can't beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.82,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the time to be saying that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:21:00.32,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to die at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:04.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,If I went home now, I'd be having nightmares!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:06.24,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:11.00,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I have my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.00,Flashback,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.78,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,...troublesome curse already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:26.79,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:29.35,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Hand it over to me or you'll be eaten, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:34.99,Flashback_Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Why would anything eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:36.03,Flashback_Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Does it taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:37.31,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:39.40,Flashback_Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You'd do it to gain stronger cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:45.51,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,There is a way to save everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:47.95,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I just need some cursed energy, \Nright, Fushiguro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:49.95,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:51.38,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:54.73,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Ryoumen Sukuna's finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:56.38,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's a special-grade cursed object!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:58.79,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's a deadly poison! He'll die for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:01.37,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,But there's a one in a million...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.30,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,a one in a million chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.71,0:22:45.55,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:48.63,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,The light feels best in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:50.68,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This is the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:52.60,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,A one-in-a-million-chance,\Nworst-case outcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.99,0:22:55.57,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The special-grade cursed \Nobject has incarnated!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.57,0:22:57.99,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,A cursed spirit's flesh is so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.99,0:23:00.98,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Where are the people? The women?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:04.58,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,What a wonderful era to be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.58,0:23:08.55,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Women and children are crawling \Neverywhere like maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.55,0:23:10.80,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:12.56,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be a massacre!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:20.39,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing with my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.39,0:23:21.38,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:23.88,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,How are you able to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:26.42,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, it's {\i1}my{\i0} body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.51,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,He's suppressing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.12,0:23:30.88,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.49,0:23:33.60,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You're no longer human.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:39.18,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Under Jujutsu regulations, Itadori Yuuji,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:43.54,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I will exorcise you as a curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.03,0:23:55.65,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(984,1)\blur3\t(25,984,1 \blur.25)}Episode 2:\N\N{\fs30}For Myself